    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="ES">1. Number of evidence based and gender sensitive policies or actions proposed, repealed, modified or developed in the intervention countries in the region.
1.1 Number of knowledge products in citizen security created including gender criteria.
1.1.1 Number of citizen security indicators disaggregated by sex proposed by the project to be tracked.
1.2.1 Number of GO staff working in citizen security trained by USG financed activities.
1.2.2 Number of public policy proposals, briefs or recommendations using a gender based approach and created by the inter-institutional coordination groups. 
1.2.3 Number of inter-institutional coordination groups with defined mechanisms for data collection and analysis using a gender based approach.</narrative>
    </description>
